          "python",
          "Customer Messages\n       \u2193\n[Text Preprocessing]\n       \u2193\n[Intent Classification Model]\n       \u2193\n[Confidence Thresholding]\n       \u251c\u2500 High confidence \u2192 Auto-response\n       \u2514\u2500 Low confidence \u2192 Route to agent\n       \u2193\n[Response Generation / Ticket System]\n       \u2193\n[Monitoring & Metrics]"
